10. Enabling Tracking

Instead of

results = model(frame)

we use

results = model.track(
    frame,
    persist=True,
    tracker="bytetrack.yaml",
    verbose=False
)
persist=True

Without

persist=True

the tracker starts from scratch every frame.

With

persist=True

the tracker remembers previous detections and maintains IDs.

tracker="bytetrack.yaml"

Explicitly tells Ultralytics to use the ByteTrack algorithm.

11. What is Track ID?

Tracking assigns every detected object a unique ID.

Example

Car → ID = 3

Next frame

Car → ID = 3

Same object.

