13. Why was box.id None initially?

Tracking needs several frames before it can confidently establish object identity.

Initial frames

is_track = False

id = None

Later

is_track = True

id = tensor([3])

This is called track initialization.

14. Safe Way to Access Track IDs

Never assume IDs exist.

if box.id is not None:
    track_id = int(box.id[0])
else:
    track_id = -1

This prevents runtime errors.

